<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in light trading in an abbreviated trading session which closed at 1300 EST/1800 GMT.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 591.48, up 2.84.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 291 to 177.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.06.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 10,918,060 compared with 21,394,240 Wednesday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1330 EST/1830 GMT)</p>
</text>
